{
  "name": "approval-wrap-up-approved",
  "description": "The buyer accepts the full terms. Kritva asks how long the offer stands and how to reach them, says it is not final until the seller confirms, and agrees nothing. The seller approves later with a note; Kritva shares it as good news and asks again; only the buyer's yes records the agreement.",
  "turns": [
